WEBVTT

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:05.500
Everyone, when you're watching Deltora Quest,

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:09.500
make sure you're in a well-lit
room and sit far away from the TV!

00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:24.040
You are my sun now

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:28.460
We all go through bad times

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:31.460
no matter who you are

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:36.890
So don't go hanging your head and feeling down

00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:45.640
Keep your head up until your heart's sky

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:51.030
is clear again

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:56.360
No matter where you are in this world

00:00:56.360 --> 00:00:59.870
if you're crying and trembling all alone

00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:05.210
I'll search for you, I promise

00:01:05.410 --> 00:01:08.880
Love will show me the way

00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:16.720
The sun dreams countless times

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:23.560
Forever and always from the horizon

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:30.900
Its shining light gives energy

00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:38.240
After all, you are my sun now

00:01:56.090 --> 00:01:57.290
<i>My name is Lief.</i>

00:01:57.610 --> 00:02:03.200
<i>Together with my companions, Barda and Jasmine, I defeated several terrifying monsters and recovered six gems.</i>

00:02:03.200 --> 00:02:07.760
<i>But to be honest, when I left the Forests of Silence to go on a journey with a stubborn old guy,</i>

00:02:06.890 --> 00:02:07.730
<i>Hey!</i>

00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:10.300
<i>along with this unreliable boy,</i>

00:02:09.460 --> 00:02:10.300
<i>What was that?</i>

00:02:10.300 --> 00:02:12.600
<i>I could only hope that
everything would be alright.</i>

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:17.100
<i>But by working together,
we've finally made it this far!</i>

00:02:17.100 --> 00:02:19.200
<i>There's only one gem remaining!</i>

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:24.710
<i>Our last perilous destination, The Valley of the Lost where the diamond is hidden, is just right ahead!</i>

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:37.700
Thaegan was defeated?!

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:39.800
Fallow!

00:02:40.200 --> 00:02:45.100
How much longer will it take for
you to capture those three?

00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:47.450
My deepest apologies.

00:02:47.450 --> 00:02:54.100
Given the route that they are taking, their probable
whereabouts are being occupied and observed...

00:02:54.100 --> 00:02:56.000
Silence!

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:58.000
I can wait no longer.

00:02:58.000 --> 00:02:59.750
My deepest apologies...!

00:02:59.750 --> 00:03:03.100
Please, just one... Grant me
just one more chance!

00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:07.600
For my next plan, I shall make use of Oacus.

00:03:07.600 --> 00:03:09.200
Oacus...?

00:03:10.100 --> 00:03:17.600
Indeed. He is blessed with a cool temperament and
beauty, as well as the ability to command fire.

00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:20.200
The Sorcerer, Oacus.

00:03:34.600 --> 00:03:36.400
What's wrong, Eli?

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:37.800
Are you hungry?

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:43.200
Just wait a little bit, Mama
will be home with food soon!

00:03:50.800 --> 00:03:56.000
This land shall be used to build arms
workshops for the Shadow Lord.

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:57.830
Leave immediately!

00:04:11.050 --> 00:04:14.200
No, let go of me! Let go!

00:04:20.600 --> 00:04:22.700
Master Oacus, whenever you're ready.

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:41.900
No... stop! Eli is... Eli is still inside!

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:58.090
Is that Eli, the doll that you love so dearly?

00:04:58.600 --> 00:05:01.850
Save Eli! Please!

00:05:01.850 --> 00:05:03.200
Don't cry.

00:05:03.800 --> 00:05:06.810
Behold. Watch carefully.

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:14.300
Noooo!!

00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:28.800
There's a river up ahead?

00:05:42.600 --> 00:05:43.800
A bridge!

00:05:43.800 --> 00:05:45.430
Be careful, Jasmine.

00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:50.100
We must cross this river in order
to reach the Valley of the Lost.

00:05:50.100 --> 00:05:54.700
I'm sure that the Shadow Lord has sent more spies
than ever to observe bridges such as this one.

00:06:02.700 --> 00:06:04.870
It doesn't seem like anyone's nearby.

00:06:05.200 --> 00:06:06.300
But,

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:09.200
I can smell animals around.

00:06:13.900 --> 00:06:19.100
Goats. The people in the nearby
villages must be herding them.

00:06:27.300 --> 00:06:28.700
"The King's Bridge

00:06:28.700 --> 00:06:35.070
Cross here for: Tora,
Where Waters Meet, Broad River."

00:06:35.800 --> 00:06:39.030
So the city of Tora is on the
other side of this bridge, then?

00:06:39.500 --> 00:06:42.410
The western capital of
the Kingdom of Deltora.

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:47.800
It is the home of the Toran clan, who
are loyal to the King of Deltora.

00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:51.500
Dain wanted to go to Tora.

00:06:51.900 --> 00:06:53.670
And yet, those bandits...

00:06:58.900 --> 00:07:03.800
I'm sure those bandits are planning to
hand him over to the Grey Guards.

00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:09.700
All we can do right now is retrieve all
seven gems as quickly as possible,

00:07:09.700 --> 00:07:11.810
and defeat the Shadow Lord.

00:07:12.300 --> 00:07:16.800
Yeah. That is the fastest way to save Dain.

00:07:16.800 --> 00:07:17.600
Let's go!

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:30.620
We need to cross carefully; we don't want to
startle the goats and have them make noise.

00:07:42.300 --> 00:07:46.970
Tremors... There are Ols guarding this
bridge, hiding among the goats!

00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:52.700
Not good. Let's cross this bridge quickly.

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:05.200
Darn, it's a trap!

00:08:17.200 --> 00:08:18.300
Shit...!

00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:27.260
Looks like we have no
choice but to fight them.

00:08:27.700 --> 00:08:29.700
We know their weakness.

00:08:29.700 --> 00:08:31.600
We must aim for the symbol on their chests!

00:09:08.800 --> 00:09:10.000
Are you okay?

00:09:10.300 --> 00:09:11.220
Thanks.

00:09:20.800 --> 00:09:23.300
Now we can't cross the bridge anymore.

00:09:24.400 --> 00:09:27.300
There's no helping it.
We can find another bridge,

00:09:27.300 --> 00:09:30.000
or look for something to ferry us across.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:30.900
Let's go!

00:09:52.600 --> 00:09:55.140
You have summoned me, Lord Fallow?

00:09:55.800 --> 00:10:01.100
A report just came in stating that the Ols
stationed at King's Bridge have been wiped out.

00:10:01.100 --> 00:10:03.400
Was it that group of three?

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:07.350
With their location pinpointed,
we will begin our pursuit.

00:10:07.350 --> 00:10:11.500
It is time to put your great power to use
for the sake of the Shadow Lord.

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:16.700
Defeat them, and reclaim
all of the gems of Deltora!

00:10:17.500 --> 00:10:19.250
Leave it in my hands.

00:10:49.800 --> 00:10:51.900
Has this village been abandoned?

00:10:51.900 --> 00:10:54.200
It must have been raided by bandits.

00:10:58.700 --> 00:11:04.100
Given that there are no animals nearby,
we shouldn't need to worry about Ols.

00:11:04.100 --> 00:11:08.760
But, Doom said that there are Ols that
can turn into inanimate objects.

00:11:09.250 --> 00:11:12.000
And if they do exist, then...

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:16.300
they could be disguising themselves as that
rock over there, or even that piece of wood.

00:11:17.300 --> 00:11:21.200
So we won't be able to rest easy
no matter where we go, then...

00:11:24.400 --> 00:11:26.400
Hey, do you hear something?

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:36.330
Someone's there.

00:11:41.330 --> 00:11:43.300
We really should turn back!

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:48.300
Why did you agree to let
Nak and Finn guard the loot?!

00:11:48.300 --> 00:11:51.400
Do you really think they would
stay on guard over there?

00:11:53.000 --> 00:11:54.500
Nak and Finn...

00:11:55.000 --> 00:11:57.200
And those two as well...

00:12:01.900 --> 00:12:04.800
So it's the bandits from back then!

00:12:04.800 --> 00:12:08.000
They're also taking shelter from the rain.

00:12:08.000 --> 00:12:12.400
Probably because the river current is too dangerous to continue their voyage.

00:12:12.400 --> 00:12:15.100
Come on, everyone.
It's not too late to go now.

00:12:15.100 --> 00:12:16.700
Let's go back!

00:12:16.700 --> 00:12:20.400
Calm down, Gren. I'm sure that
Nak and Finn are waiting for us.

00:12:20.400 --> 00:12:26.800
If we can sell that Resistance boy to the
Grey Guards, we'll get a big payout.

00:12:26.800 --> 00:12:29.700
It's obvious that those two
will want their share, as well.

00:12:29.700 --> 00:12:31.300
They're talking about Dain!

00:12:33.800 --> 00:12:34.800
It's their ship!

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:38.350
So Dain is on that thing?

00:12:38.350 --> 00:12:39.140
Yeah.

00:12:39.300 --> 00:12:43.600
They have the River Queen's
treasure within their reach!

00:12:43.600 --> 00:12:46.700
I would guarantee that they're
running away with it right now!

00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:49.800
Oh, be quiet! Shut that filthy mouth of yours!

00:12:50.900 --> 00:12:53.500
You bastard... what the hell are you doing?!

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:56.300
Yeah! Get him!

00:12:57.300 --> 00:12:59.500
Let's take this chance to save Dain.

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:01.100
If we can take that ship...

00:13:01.100 --> 00:13:02.000
Let's go.

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:29.400
Go.

00:14:09.500 --> 00:14:12.300
They must have used this boat to get to shore.

00:14:12.300 --> 00:14:14.110
Dain must be in there...!

00:14:23.350 --> 00:14:25.000
I feel sick...

00:14:25.000 --> 00:14:28.300
Honestly, why are <i>we</i> the only
ones left on this damn ship?

00:14:28.300 --> 00:14:31.120
Enough of that, hurry up and
pick a card; it's your turn.

00:14:34.100 --> 00:14:36.300
Damn it! It's Joker!

00:14:36.300 --> 00:14:37.550
Alright!

00:14:37.550 --> 00:14:39.900
Shit! This is not my lucky day...

00:14:56.800 --> 00:14:59.100
Huh? What's up?

00:14:59.100 --> 00:15:02.300
Did you hear something just now?

00:15:02.300 --> 00:15:05.600
It's the storm. Of course there would be noises.

00:15:07.200 --> 00:15:08.700
I'm at my limit.

00:15:09.200 --> 00:15:11.500
I'm going outside for some fresh air.

00:15:12.400 --> 00:15:14.880
Be careful not to slip and fall overboard.

00:15:30.200 --> 00:15:31.800
I feel sick...

00:15:37.050 --> 00:15:38.900
If you want to throw up, do it over there!

00:15:55.800 --> 00:15:57.500
Who are you people?!

00:16:01.700 --> 00:16:03.300
What are you here for?!

00:16:03.300 --> 00:16:04.800
Where is Dain?

00:16:04.800 --> 00:16:05.900
Dain...?!

00:16:05.900 --> 00:16:09.000
It's three against one. Just surrender quietly!

00:16:09.700 --> 00:16:10.700
Shut up!

00:16:21.900 --> 00:16:24.700
Crap. We won't be able to get
inside the cabin like this.

00:16:27.300 --> 00:16:29.700
Please, go and find Dain.

00:16:39.700 --> 00:16:40.460
Oh no!

00:16:47.100 --> 00:16:49.800
What are you doing?
Let's hurry and return to the ship!

00:16:54.800 --> 00:16:57.300
Don't just stand there! You should fight too!

00:16:59.100 --> 00:16:59.940
What's the matter?!

00:17:00.600 --> 00:17:02.610
Something is... coming.

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:12.300
M-Monsters!

00:17:17.500 --> 00:17:18.900
What the hell are they?!

00:17:18.900 --> 00:17:21.400
Are they monsters serving
under the Shadow Lord?

00:17:43.800 --> 00:17:44.900
What do we do?

00:17:44.900 --> 00:17:47.250
Like hell I'm gonna fight these monsters!

00:17:47.250 --> 00:17:48.200
Let's get out of here!

00:17:54.000 --> 00:17:55.600
Our ship...!

00:17:56.000 --> 00:17:57.400
Hurry up and get back onto the boat!

00:17:57.400 --> 00:17:58.800
There <i>is</i> no boat!

00:17:58.800 --> 00:18:01.600
What?! Who is behind this...?!

00:18:05.600 --> 00:18:08.550
You people have business on that ship too?

00:18:08.550 --> 00:18:10.400
Wh-Who the hell are you?!

00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:28.300
Shall we go?

00:18:28.800 --> 00:18:30.740
No no no, we'd rather not.

00:18:46.900 --> 00:18:50.100
Lief! These are creatures of magic.

00:18:50.500 --> 00:18:55.000
Unless we beat the one who summoned
them, we can do nothing against them!

00:18:57.200 --> 00:19:00.700
Jasmine! Leave this to us and find Dain!

00:19:03.900 --> 00:19:04.900
Who are you?!

00:19:07.400 --> 00:19:10.900
I am the Sorcerer Oacus.

00:19:10.900 --> 00:19:13.500
So it's you! You're the summoner!

00:19:17.100 --> 00:19:17.790
Barda!

00:19:19.200 --> 00:19:25.700
As per Lord Fallow's orders, I will take the
gems of Deltora, as well as your lives.

00:19:34.800 --> 00:19:35.700
Lief!

00:19:37.800 --> 00:19:40.300
You just stay here and watch.

00:19:47.700 --> 00:19:49.700
Stop! Let me go!

00:19:50.500 --> 00:19:52.600
Stop struggling so much.

00:19:53.600 --> 00:19:59.080
Watch closely as your precious
companion dies before you.

00:20:03.300 --> 00:20:05.000
Kree! Filli!

00:20:12.630 --> 00:20:13.630
Lief...!

00:20:20.400 --> 00:20:23.200
I think it's about time we stopped
playing around, wouldn't you say?

00:20:23.200 --> 00:20:24.500
Please stop!

00:20:26.100 --> 00:20:28.100
Lief! Jasmine!

00:20:33.150 --> 00:20:34.400
Ah, right!

00:20:44.400 --> 00:20:46.300
Stop it!!

00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:20.600
Barda! Hang on!

00:21:26.700 --> 00:21:28.790
Dain... so you were alright?

00:21:37.400 --> 00:21:39.400
Jasmine! Lief!

00:21:42.200 --> 00:21:44.400
Are you both okay?

00:22:38.580 --> 00:22:47.800
How long has it truly been, I wonder?

00:22:47.800 --> 00:22:57.680
I've been watching the moon all this time, bathing in its light

00:22:57.680 --> 00:23:05.150
As we moved closer, a goddess passed over us

00:23:05.150 --> 00:23:14.820
And just like that, my little dream was carried away

00:23:15.660 --> 00:23:20.500
I saw you when I looked to the night sky

00:23:20.460 --> 00:23:25.090
Now that I think of it, your name was written there too

00:23:25.790 --> 00:23:29.380
Above me, a shooting star

00:23:29.380 --> 00:23:32.800
fades into the distance

00:23:33.890 --> 00:23:38.430
When the moonlight starts to wane

00:23:38.430 --> 00:23:43.140
I stand under the lazy morning's light

00:23:44.060 --> 00:23:47.440
And when that same moon rises

00:23:47.440 --> 00:23:56.280
I'll start moving all over again

00:24:07.200 --> 00:24:09.000
<i>The Sorcerer Oacus.</i>

00:24:09.300 --> 00:24:12.190
<i>A sorcerer who commands fire.</i>

00:24:12.190 --> 00:24:15.660
<i>He has a beautiful appearance, but a cruel heart.</i>

00:24:15.660 --> 00:24:19.600
<i>He has two fire monsters
that can transform into wings.</i>

00:24:20.400 --> 00:24:22.600
The beautiful yet unusual city, Tora.

00:24:22.600 --> 00:24:26.200
In this city, we learn of several truths.

00:24:26.200 --> 00:24:28.200
As well as Doom's true identity.

00:24:28.700 --> 00:24:31.600
Is he our enemy, or our ally?

00:24:30.860 --> 00:24:34.780
The Vow of the Torans

00:24:32.000 --> 00:24:34.770
Next time, "The Vow of the Torans".

00:24:49.820 --> 00:24:54.800
See you next time
